name: beam-bundles
description: Author, publish, tag, pin, and govern beamo manifest bundles — the `beam bundles` command family. Build a bundle of services, storages, and portal extensions, publish it to the catalog, move tags, widen its ACL scope, pin checksums into a realm, and yank/prune retired versions.
