## Plan → Publish

Publishing builds the bundle's components, diffs the result against the currently-published `latest`, and uploads what changed. The recommended flow is to **plan first**, review the diff, then **publish** — reusing the plan so you publish exactly what you reviewed.

### 1. Plan
`bundles plan` builds the bundle (restricted to just its components), computes the diff against the published `latest`, and saves a plan file to a temp folder for reuse.
```
beam_exec("bundles plan checkout-stack -q")
```
{{ if commands["bundles plan"] }}{{ if (array.size commands["bundles plan"].arguments) > 0 }}
#### `beam bundles plan` arguments
| Argument | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
{{ for arg in commands["bundles plan"].arguments }}| `{{ arg.name }}` | {{ arg.type }} | {{ arg.description }} |
{{ end }}{{ end }}{{ if (array.size commands["bundles plan"].options) > 0 }}
#### `beam bundles plan` options
| Option | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
{{ for opt in commands["bundles plan"].options }}| `{{ opt.name }}` | {{ opt.type }} | {{ opt.description }} |
{{ end }}{{ end }}{{ end }}

### 2. Publish
`bundles publish` re-uses a saved plan (the most recent one, or a specific file) or builds and diffs inline. It prompts for confirmation before mutating the catalog unless you pass `-q`/`--quiet`.
```
beam_exec("bundles publish checkout-stack --from-latest-plan -q")
```
Behavior worth knowing (the flags themselves are in the options table below):
- Publishing always creates the checksum at the `realm` ACL tier; you can widen it in the same step or later with `bundles acl` (see *Tags & Visibility*).
- Advancing a tag alongside the publish also moves that tag to the freshly-published checksum (in addition to `latest`).
- If the diff is a no-op, publish reports "nothing to publish" and makes no change.
- A saved plan is only valid against the catalog state it was diffed from; if `latest` moved since planning, publish rejects it — re-run `bundles plan`.
{{ if commands["bundles publish"] }}{{ if (array.size commands["bundles publish"].arguments) > 0 }}
#### `beam bundles publish` arguments
