|---|---|---|
{{ for opt in commands["bundles yank"].options }}| `{{ opt.name }}` | {{ opt.type }} | {{ opt.description }} |
{{ end }}{{ end }}{{ end }}

Because a yanked checksum can linger in a manifest, **`bundles prune-yanked`** scans this workspace's pinned references and reports (or clears) any that point at a yanked checksum — so you can re-pin a newer one before releasing.
```
beam_exec("bundles prune-yanked -q")
```
